e dil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan...\nKehndi hundi si, \"Chann tak raah bana de\nTaare ne pasand mainu, hethaan saare laa de\"\nOhna taareyan de vich jadon mainu vekhegi\nMeri yaad jadon aaugi taan pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan...\nRaas na aaya tainu\nNi jo dil da mehel banaya si\nTod ke moti phullan de\nOs mehel 'ch boota laaya si\nNi jivein saanu chhadd gayi aa ni tu, allhade\nJadon tainu koi chhaduga taan...\nHo, jivein saanu chhadd gayi aa ni tu, allhade\nJadon tainu koi chhaduga taan pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan pata lagguga\nIshqe de raahaan vich rudh ke reh gaye haan\nLokaan ditte taane-mehne hass ke seh gaye haan\nIshqe de raahaan vich rudh ke reh gaye haan\nLokaan ditte taane-mehne hass ke seh gaye haan\nSaade pyaar nu tu pairaan tale rodh'di rahi\nJazbaat jadon rudhe odon pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan pata lagguga\nDil naal laare ni tu laun waaliye\nDil tera jadon tuttuga taan pata lagguga\n\n"}